{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["לא ימיש עמוד הענן יומם ועמוד האש וגו׳. That the pillar of fire complemented the pillar of cloud — for it is written לפני העם, not מלפני העם, implying that sometimes both of them were before the people." "<b> לא ימיש</b> Two times in the Masorah; here and the other in Joshua: לא ימיש מתוך האהל. Just as the clouds complemented one another, so did Joshua rise early in the morning while the pillar of fire still stood, to learn, and in the evening he went ahead and learned while the pillar of cloud still stood — and that is לא ימיש: just as the clouds did not depart, so Joshua did not depart מתוך האהל. Therefore he merited to go לפני העם."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:47.176114981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}